        "Description": "The ICA has recieved a contract for two targets staying on Haven Island. Staff and clients alike are misbehaving and a message must be sent to both to keep island order.\r\rYour first target is Jakson Mamao. A lazy personal trainer.\r\rYour second is Mirtilla Mood. A dissatisfied customer who protests Haven Island by locking herself in a public restroom and never uses it.\r\rYou may want to bring something to unlock doors, make someone sick, or start your mission near a pool.\r\rGood luck 47.",
